1 NAME Anders Petersson /Reimers/
2 GIVN Anders Petersson
2 SURN Reimers
2 NICK Rejmers
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1 JAN 1727
2 PLAC St. Olai
2 ADDR
