2 CONT High School Ex. in Uppsala 1799, sergeant Göta Garde 4/8 1800, ensign 23/5 1801, lieutenant 18/2 1805, captain Västgöta Dals Fältjägarregemente 19/4 1810. Took successfully part in the wars against Finland and Norway. Knight of Sw
2 CONC ord Order. (RSO). Major and Regimental Commander of Wermlands Feldtjägare 3/6 1817. Postmaster in Westervik 21/12 1833  till his death 1853.
