1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert married Maria (Mararetha) Hoijer and with her had a son called Gabriel. According to Hellstrom, his daughter Catharina married William Helleday [SSNE 787]. When Helleday died, sometime in 1679?, Robert took 
2 CONC on the service of one John Guthrie [SSNE 2369]who had been in Helleday's service. From c.1675-1690 Robert Petrie and his sons Robert and Wellam operated Hofors bruk. Wellam continued running this until his own death in 1706. 
