1 NAME Robert /Petrie/
2 GIVN Robert
2 SURN Petrie
2 _MARNM Petre
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC I svärfaderns grav, so om altaret i stadskyrka
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Heliga Trefaldighets fg
3 CITY Arboga
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BIRT
