1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Got his degree in 1866; The same year he started working at the Skövde Grammar School; He became the head master of that school in 1883-1893; From 1894 he had a leave of absence; and in 1898 he left his position; H
2 CONC e was awarded the RVO medal – Knight of the Royal order of Vasa; He died in Skövde 2/4 1905 of heart failure (vitae organicum cordis); He never married.
