2 FILE https://media.geni.com/p13/45/31/14/e6/5344483a69b3e2bb/birger_martin_hall_original.jpg?hash=f7ccc3c3ae0f40f65a3f905087ca5a811caf3a493b0eaef343c19dea7aedaf6b.1795939199
