2 NICK Marks von Würtemberg
1 NAME Gotthard Vilhelm /Marcks/
2 GIVN Gotthard Vilhelm
2 SURN Marcks
2 _MARNM Marcks von Würtemberg
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Lerbo kyrka
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Lerbo
3 CITY Katrineholm
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BIRT
2 DATE 14 MAY 1688
2 ADDR
3 CITY Riga
3 STAE Livonia
3 CTRY Latvia
1 DEAT
2 DATE 17 FEB 1778
2 PLAC Gotthardsberg
2 ADDR
