1 NAME Nils /Helenius/
2 GIVN Nils
2 _MARNM Helenius
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 3 JAN 1706
2 ADDR
3 STAE Skaraborg
3 CTRY Sverige
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 MAY 1791
2 PLAC Loringa Lunnagård
